, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>頂<rt>いただ</rt></ruby>いたお<ruby>花<rt>はな</rt></ruby>たち</span><span class=\"s5\">❁︎</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2019-06-13/29515_3.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_7299.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><ruby>素敵<rt>すてき</rt></ruby>なお<ruby>花<rt>はな</rt></ruby>をありがとうございます！！！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>今回<rt>こんかい</rt></ruby>はブルー<ruby>系<rt>けい</rt></ruby>が<ruby>多<rt>おお</rt></ruby>かったですね</span><span class=\"s4\">☺️</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">ピンクも<ruby>可愛<rt>かわい</rt></ruby>い！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>次<rt>つぎ</rt></ruby>の<ruby>握手<rt>あくしゅ</rt></ruby><ruby>会<rt>かい</rt></ruby>は</span><span class=\"s1\">…</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">6</span><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>月<rt>つき</rt></ruby></span><span class=\"s1\">22</span><span class=\"s2\">・</span><span class=\"s1\">23</span><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>日<rt>にち</rt></ruby>の<ruby>京都<rt>きょうと</rt></ruby>で</span><span class=\"s1\">2</span><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>日<rt>にち</rt></ruby><ruby>連続<rt>れんぞく</rt></ruby>になります！</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">22</span><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>日<rt>ひ</rt></ruby>は「キュン」<ruby>全国<rt>ぜんこく</rt></ruby><ruby>握手<rt>あくしゅ</rt></ruby><ruby>会<rt>かい</rt></ruby></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">23</span><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>日<rt>ひ</rt></ruby>は「<ruby>黒<rt>くろ</rt></ruby>い<ruby>羊<rt>ひつじ</rt></ruby>」<ruby>個別<rt>こべつ</rt></ruby><ruby>握手<rt>あくしゅ</rt></ruby><ruby>会<rt>かい</rt></ruby></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">となっております！！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>是非<rt>ぜひ</rt></ruby>、<ruby>遊<rt>あそ</rt></ruby>びに<ruby>来<rt>き</rt></ruby>てください</span><span class=\"s4\">☺️💓</span></span></p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\">❀</span><span class=\"s1\">* </span><span class=\"s2\">❀。</span><span class=\"s1\">. </span><span class=\"s2\">✿</span><span class=\"s1\"> * </span><span class=\"s2\">❀</span><span class=\"s1\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">｡</span><span class=\"s1\">* </span><span class=\"s2\">❀</span><span class=\"s1\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">❀</span><span class=\"s1\"> * .</span><span class=\"s2\">❀</span><span class=\"s1\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">｡</span><span class=\"s1\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">✿</span><span class=\"s1\"> * </span><span class=\"s2\">❀</span><span class=\"s1\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">❀</span><span class=\"s1\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">｡</span><span class=\"s1\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">✿</span><span class=\"s1\"> *&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"s2\">ちょっとした<ruby>小坂<rt>こさか</rt></ruby>のおふざけタイム＆<ruby>前回<rt>ぜんかい</rt></ruby><ruby>載<rt>の</rt></ruby>せきれなかった<ruby>写真<rt>しゃしん</rt></ruby>たちを<ruby>大量<rt>たいりょう</rt></ruby>に</span><span class=\"s1\">…</span></p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p4\"><span class=\"s1\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2019-06-13/29515_4.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_7222.jpeg\"></span></p><p class=\"p4\"><span class=\"s1\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2019-06-13/29515_5.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_7224.jpeg\"></span></p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p4\"><span class=\"s1\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2019-06-13/29515_6.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_6931.jpeg\"></span></p><p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>守屋<rt>もりや</rt></ruby>さん♪</span></p><p class=\"p4\"><span class=\"s1\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2019-06-13/29515_7.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_6937.jpeg\"></span></p><p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>武<rt>たけ</rt></ruby><ruby>元<rt>はじめ</rt></ruby>ちゃん♪</span></p><p class=\"p4\"><span class=\"s1\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2019-06-13/29515_8.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_6938.jpeg\"></span></p><p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"s2\">ほのちゃん♪</span></p><p class=\"p4\"><span class=\"s1\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2019-06-13/29515_9.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_6941.jpeg\"></span></p><p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>尾関<rt>おぜき</rt></ruby>さんとほのちゃん♪</span></p><p class=\"p4\"><span class=\"s1\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2019-06-13/29515_10.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_7018.jpeg\"></span></p><p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>松田<rt>まつだ</rt></ruby>ちゃん♪</span></p><p class=\"p4\"><span class=\"s1\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2019-06-13/29515_11.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_7021.jpeg\"></span></p><p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>関<rt>せき</rt></ruby>ちゃん♪</span></p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>欅<rt>けやき</rt></ruby><ruby>坂<rt>ざか</rt></ruby>さんともいっぱい<ruby>撮<rt>と</rt></ruby>ってもらいました</span><span class=\"s3\">✨</span></p><p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"s2\">ありがとうございます((</span><span class=\"s1\"